(N'ae-pipeline-health-review-msx-cleanup',N'Pipeline health review & MSX cleanup',N'Surface at-risk committed deals, run hygiene checks, prioritize fixes, and update MSX with clean data and forecast comments.',N'ae-ent',N'pipeline-forecasting',N'Insight',N'Quarterly',N'High',N'FullySupported',N'None',N'All',30,N'Clean, accurate pipeline enabling reliable forecasting',N'Review my full pipeline: flag committed-at-risk deals by account with next best actions, then run a hygiene check — opportunities missing an updated close date, recent customer contact, or partner attach. Group by deal stage, prioritize by ARR closing this quarter, give me the single next fix for each flagged item, draft an updated forecast comment for stalled deals, and flag any work in progress that should be captured as a new opportunity in MSX.',NULL,N'["Auto-detects stale opportunities and missing data", "Groups issues by MCEM stage for systematic fixes", "Suggests next fix with owner assignment"]',1,CAST(1 AS bit)),
